^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A read of a pointer from a union whose only member is a byte array was not
rewritten to the bytes of that member: the pointer read from the union was
not a constant, every address-taken function of a compatible type was a
target of the call through it, and the recursion through `call' was not
bounded.
